WEBVTT

00:47:29.996 --> 00:47:33.663
and a couple of them sort of put their
hand on my back and put their hand

00:47:33.663 --> 00:47:35.663
on my shoulder to comfort me.

00:47:36.121 --> 00:47:40.121
Wow. And I thought, oh, OK.

00:47:40.288 --> 00:47:45.704
I, I it was so clear, crystal clear to me
because I was watching that scene and

00:47:45.704 --> 00:47:48.496
I wasn't crying because
it's not sad anymore.

00:47:48.996 --> 00:47:52.079
But when I watch the scene
of my mom dying.

00:47:53.038 --> 00:47:55.496
I cried, Oh, that's so sad,

00:47:55.871 --> 00:47:58.829
and it doesn't mean that
one thing isn't sad

00:47:58.829 --> 00:48:02.538
and one thing is it means that there
are different kinds of sorrow